---
import ContentLayout from "astro-theme-university/layouts/ContentLayout.astro";
import SessionsGrid from "../../components/SessionsGrid.astro";
import { sessionLabels, siteConfig } from "../../site-config";
---

<ContentLayout
  title={sessionLabels.plural}
  description="Twelve weeks of fieldwork: what to bring, what happens in the room, and what leaves it."
  {...siteConfig}
>
  <p>
    The weekly contact hour in this course is a lab rather than a tutorial,
    because almost everything worth knowing about a queue is only visible from
    beside it. You will spend these hours counting people, rolling dice,
    breaking your own schedulers, sorting case cards against the clock, and
    once, in week 10, boarding a taped-out aircraft cabin four different ways.
  </p>
  <p>
    Each lab lists what to bring. Most weeks the honest answer is a stopwatch
    and something to write on.
  </p>
  <SessionsGrid />
</ContentLayout>
